{"server":"cn","storyId":"1stact_level_a001_04_end","groupId":"1stact","stageId":"a001_04","title":"污点证人","storyCode":"GT-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/a001/level_a001_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"fdd750dc50f81f01ae504684ea219c89b446d3d5f56098a2d2fa23d142eea9ef","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_caveentrance"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"咕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这家伙是个瘸的！先解决掉他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"格拉尼！继续耗下去，我们全得交代在这儿了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你这么说！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"快！带着可萝尔走！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"我受了伤，会拖慢你们的速度！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"之后我会找办法和你们会合的！走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"说好了，记得要来拿你的那份！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"快走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"她们跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"大鲍勃","speakerId":"avg_npc_010","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的敌人是我！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_forest"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......交战的声音似乎平息下来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"但是抱歉，可萝尔，现在我们没有休息的时间，还得快走才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"没事......那个，鲍勃先生他，不知道怎么样了......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可能，要给他一些时间吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"给他些时间......？你是说——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"可萝尔！你没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，被这个树根绊了一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"来，拉住我的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"能走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......没事的，只是擦伤。就像你说的，我们还是别停下脚步比较好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"只要穿过森林就是莫拉蒂山的山脚下了，我们得进入半山腰第二个洞窟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"只能从洞口进去吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，里面还有很多岔路和暗道，不过我知道该怎么走。宝藏就在洞窟的最深处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。这样的话......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"咦？好、好可怕的声音......远处有什么爆炸了吗......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"仔细听，还有呐喊和惨叫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"是战斗的声音。还没结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"......可萝尔，你害怕吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"......我很害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，为了让我的村子平静下来，让我们的土地重归安宁......我也有一定要去做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"你真坚强啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"可萝尔","speakerId":"avg_npc_003","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"格拉尼","speakerId":"char_220_grani","isRemote":false,"text":"没事。事不宜迟，我们继续前进吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","aliases":["整合运动"]},{"speakerId":"char_220_grani","aliases":["格拉尼"]}]}
